# `terminal.list`



**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.terminals.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `include_ended` | `bool` |

## Returns

`ListTerminalsResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `sessions` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call terminal.list --json '{ "include_ended": false }'
```

Kind: read.

